e in flight, attention can survey and rank what needs focus."}]},{"id":"blk-41915","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47050","text":"Autonomy modes:"}]},{"id":"blk-41916","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47051","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-47052","text":" (read-only prioritization)"}]}],"id":"blk-41917","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47053","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"},{"id":"spn-47054","text":" (recommend actions)"}]}],"id":"blk-41919","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47055","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-47056","text":" (dispatch bounded actions)"}]}],"id":"blk-41921","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47057","text":"Attention combines urgency, coverage state, and topology complexity to prioritize execution."}]},{"id":"blk-41924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47058","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41925","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47059","text":"8) Consolidation Cycle (Memory Maintenance)"}]},{"id":"blk-41926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47060","text":"Consolidation keeps memory quality healthy over time."}]},{"id":"blk-41927","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47061","text":"The 7-stage pipeline includes:"}]},{"id":"blk-41928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47062","text":"1. Confidence decay 2. Prune weak nodes 3. Prune weak edges 4. Strengthen co-activated edges 5. Merge similar nodes 6. Promote timescale (fast → medium → slow → glacial) 7. Generate abstractions from episodic clusters"}]},{"id":"blk-41929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47063","text":"Operationally, run consolidation:"}]},{"id":"blk-41930","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47064","text":"at session boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-41931","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47065","text":"after heavy write bursts"}]}],"id":"blk-41933","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41936","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47066","text":"periodically during long autonomous loops"}]}],"id":"blk-41935","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41937","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47067","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41938","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47068","text":"9) End-to-End Example Walkthrough"}]},{"id":"blk-41939","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47069","text":"A complete interaction often looks like this:"}]},{"id":"blk-41940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47070","text":"1. Agent retrieves context for user task. 2. Runtime returns ranked results + causal context + topology signal. 3. Agent performs work and returns output. 4. Agent stores key new semantic/procedural/episodic nodes. 5. Agent reports outcome against causal nodes. 6. Goal progress is updated. 7. Coverage is reviewed before next consequential step. 8. Consolidation runs to maintain graph quality."}]},{"id":"blk-41941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47071","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41942","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47072","text":"10) Operational Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-41943","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47073","text":"Before ending a productive session:"}]},{"id":"blk-41944","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47074","text":"[ ] Store key durable knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-41945","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47075","text":"[ ] Report outcomes for consequential actions"}]}],"id":"blk-41947","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47076","text":"[ ] Update linked goals/progress/status"}]}],"id":"blk-41949","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47077","text":"[ ] Trigger or verify consolidation"}]}],"id":"blk-41951","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47078","text":"[ ] Confirm runtime remains healthy"}]}],"id":"blk-41953","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41955","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47079","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41956","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47080","text":"11) Common Failure Patterns to Avoid"}]},{"id":"blk-41957","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47081","text":"skipping retrieval on non-trivial tasks"}]}],"id":"blk-41958","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47082","text":"losing causal context before outcome reporting"}]}],"id":"blk-41960","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47083","text":"inflating confidence without evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-41962","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47084","text":"storing kitchen-sink nodes"}]}],"id":"blk-41964","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47085","text":"fabricating coverage or outcome signals"}]}],"id":"blk-41966","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41969","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47086","text":"ignoring repeated "},{"id":"spn-47087","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-47088","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-47089","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-47090","text":" routing"}]}],"id":"blk-41968","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41970","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47091","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41971","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47092","text":"12) Suggested Next Reads"}]},{"id":"blk-41972","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47093","marks":["code"],"text":"quickstart"}]}],"id":"blk-41973","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41976","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47094","marks":["code"],"text":"architecture"}]}],"id":"blk-41975","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47095","marks":["code"],"text":"mcp-tools"}]}],"id":"blk-41977","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41980","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47096","marks":["code"],"text":"operations"}]}],"id":"blk-41979","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47097","marks":["code"],"text":"skills/SKILLS"}]}],"id":"blk-41981","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41983","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47098","text":"If you are integrating an autonomous agent, treat this walkthrough as the runtime backbone and the skills docs as strict operating policy."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierayqfy756v5ms5ryk346hra4ccytffmgbd6z7od2bj66ch37lbvmva","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}